From 362ab71987d1c4472e45d9d0834cbc0355811afd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sn3ro <zak.darek@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 04:23:52 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat(mcp): list_posts, select_post, preview_post and
 save_post_script

Four MCP post tools for post authoring and selection:
- list_posts: the built-in posts (the machine kinds each serves and
  the manifest fields) and the .cps files of the user posts folder
  (CAMCRAFT_POSTS, else <data dir>/camcraft/posts).
- select_post: SelectPost through the session History (one undo step).
- preview_post: the engine on a built-in sample or the document stream,
  no file written; a failure answers ok: false with the 1-based line.
- save_post_script: a plain file name only, the script must load and
  run, atomic write, overwrite only when asked.
A live app session asks before save_post_script (FileWrite) and
select_post (LimitEdit). The MCP reference and the camcraft-mcp skill
list the tools.

Fixes #2074

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
