+- `select_post { "post": string | null }` (#2074): Select the document's post as one undo step (`SelectPost`): a built-in name, a `.cps` path, or `null` for the default built-in post. A file must read and run; a name must be in the registry; the post already selected is refused. A setup's own post is `set_setup_post`.
